ggml-cuda: fused Qwen4Exp hyper-connection ops (ADD nodes tagged op_params[7]=ZM_HC_MAGIC)

Replaces the SCALE/SIGMOID/SCALE/REPEAT/MUL/ADD chain of hc_combine and the SIGMOID/MUL/CONT/ADD.../SCALE
tail of hc_mix with one kernel each. The kernels keep ggml's float sequence (same sigmoid, scale*x+bias,
separate multiply and add roundings), verified bit-identical on decode logits. Neighbouring fusion patterns
never consume a tagged node.

